  "text": "The abstracts of all eight chapters of Sharira Sthana are presented here for introductory knowledge about its chapters. For more knowledge, the readers can go to the individual chapters.\n\nContents\n\n1 Chapter 1. Knowledge of holistic human being- Katidhapurusha Sharira adhyaya\n\n2 Chapter 2. Different clans and aspects of the Human Birth – Atulyagotriya Sharira\n\n3 Chapter 3. Factors responsible for Embryogenesis- Khuddika Garbhavakranti Sharira\n\n4 Chapter 4. Detailed sequential growth and development of embryo in womb – Mahatigarbhavakranti Sharira\n\n5 Chapter 5. Detailed Study of the Purusha – Holistic human being – Purusha Vichaya Sharira\n\n6 Chapter 6. Analytical study of the Human body – Sharira Vichaya Sharira\n\n7 Chapter 7. Numerological account of human body constituents – Sankhya Sharira\n\n8 Chapter 8. Obstetrics, Maternal Health and Neonatal Care –Jatisutriya Sharira\n\nChapter 1. Knowledge of holistic human being- Katidhapurusha Sharira adhyaya\n\nChapter 2. Different clans and aspects of the Human Birth – Atulyagotriya Sharira\n\nChapter 3. Factors responsible for Embryogenesis- Khuddika Garbhavakranti Sharira\n\nChapter 4. Detailed sequential growth and development of embryo in womb – Mahatigarbhavakranti Sharira\n\nChapter 5. Detailed Study of the Purusha – Holistic human being – Purusha Vichaya Sharira\n\nChapter 6. Analytical study of the Human body – Sharira Vichaya Sharira\n\nChapter 7. Numerological account of human body constituents – Sankhya Sharira\n\nChapter 8. Obstetrics, Maternal Health and Neonatal Care – Jatisutriya Sharira",
